# The Fighting Fourth (crystalWar 7) beside its rivals at Roderich, Gebhardt, the Barricade and Adelbrecht: What Price
# Loyalty (group 5, on Lua) at Prog 1 (Roderich 11, an Event) and Her Memories: Azure Footfalls (group 10, on Lua)
# accepted (Gebhardt 14 at Prog 2, the Barricade 16 at Prog 4, Adelbrecht 360 at Prog 5: Progress events) or available
# (Adelbrecht 359 at Prog 1, with WotG Her Memories and allegiance 2), all by GMs. Each Fighting Fourth reply is shown
# against a rival, twice where a tie or a reply of another kind would show only on the second talk (ties go to the first
# container: Azure Footfalls, The Fighting Fourth, What Price Loyalty; then they rotate by the last event). A level 99
# Warrior in North Gustaberg [S] with both quests accepted, Prog 1 (missions as Steamed Rams' main flow). Roderich: 104
# over 11, Prog 2; Prog 1 again (a GM): 104; Prog 2: 105 ties 11, twice; Prog 3: 109 ties 11, twice. Completed (a GM):
# 109 (replaceDefault) under 11, twice. What Price Loyalty set available, The Fighting Fourth accepted again (GMs),
# Azure Footfalls accepted at Prog 2. Gebhardt: Prog 0: 102 ties 14: 14 (Azure Prog 3); Prog 2 again (a GM): 102 (Prog
# 1); 103 under 14, twice (Azure's Prog set back each time); Prog 2: 107 under 14, twice; Prog 3: 108 under 14, twice.
# Prog 2, Azure Prog 4: the Barricade: 106 ties 16: 16; Azure Prog 4 again: 106 (Prog 3). Bastok Markets [S], Azure Prog
# 5: Adelbrecht: Prog 0: 140 under 360, twice (Azure set accepted at Prog 5 again after each 360 completes it); Prog 1:
# 141, twice; Prog 2: 142, twice; Prog 3: 143 ties 360: 360, then 143: completed, allegiance 2. The Fighting Fourth set
# available, WotG Her Memories, Azure Footfalls available at Prog 1 (GMs): 139 ties 359: 359 (Azure begun); Azure
# available at Prog 1 again: 139, option 0. The Blue letter (a GM): 139 (0, 0) ties 359: 359 (Azure begun); Azure
# available at Prog 1 again: 139 (0, 0), option 0.
